Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.65,0:00:03.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男子啦啦隊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.61,0:00:05.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那一定會是一支前所未有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:09.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活力四射而又愉快的嶄新隊伍
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.61,0:00:13.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要和你一起做一件新的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.78,0:00:17.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.41,0:00:20.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總覺得阿晴的應援聲裡有種力量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.33,0:00:22.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以肩膀受傷的時候 我反而松了口氣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.63,0:00:25.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想這下就能放棄柔道了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.67,0:00:29.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們永遠是一起的 不是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.97,0:00:32.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你根本沒必要放棄柔道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.97,0:00:34.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退出的時候也要一起退
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.59,0:00:36.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧 男子啦啦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.31,0:00:40.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為他人應援這件事將成為主角
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.77,0:00:43.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,助他人一臂之力 也會鼓舞...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.02,0:00:45.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.27,0:00:49.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想在學園祭的舞臺上做同樣的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.32,0:00:50.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別說得那麼輕鬆
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.65,0:00:52.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且全男生的啦啦隊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.99,0:00:53.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開什麼玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦隊不是能鬧著玩的運動
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.37,0:00:58.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我反對
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.83,0:01:00.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們就想做些有新意又有意思的事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.96,0:01:02.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有想做的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.29,0:01:04.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.50,0:01:07.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無論是不認可全男生組建啦啦隊的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.96,0:01:09.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是那些說我們做不到的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.38,0:01:13.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想打破一直以來的自己
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.18,0:01:17.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咱們一起去破壞一切吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.39,0:01:18.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.97,0:01:20.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.60,0:01:22.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.94,0:01:25.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就這祥 我們迎來了初次登臺
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.48,0:01:26.30,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,七個人一起看到的景色
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.04,0:01:48.59,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}結束漫不經心度過的每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.75,0:01:52.59,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}滿心想要脫離現狀
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:58.26,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我總是不敢踏出第一步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.47,0:02:02.39,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}每次是你牽著我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.56,0:02:08.23,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}帶我去看新的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:10.61,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}世界變幻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.73,0:02:12.69,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}邁出最初一步
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.69,0:02:15.95,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}仿佛帶來了變化
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.11,0:02:21.83,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不再擔心 我們在一起能去到任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.95,0:02:23.41,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去吧 飛翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.54,0:02:24.96,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}以最本真的模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:28.17,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}雖然也有不安也有迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.33,0:02:34.84,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}但有太多事情 不試試沒法知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.97,0:02:36.38,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去吧 飛翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.51,0:02:41.39,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}伸手仿佛能觸碰天空
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.47,0:02:44.48,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我們不再孤單
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.64,0:02:49.65,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}投身新世界
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.04,0:01:48.59,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}何気なく過ごしてる　日々に蓋してしまう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.75,0:01:52.59,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}抜け出したい気持ちは山々です
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:58.26,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}初めの一歩目が　踏み出せない僕に
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.47,0:02:02.39,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}いつでも君が僕の手引っ張って
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.56,0:02:08.23,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}新しいモノを見に　連れて行ってくれる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.36,0:02:10.61,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}世界が変わる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.73,0:02:12.69,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}初めの一歩目で
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.69,0:02:15.95,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}変われた気がした
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.11,0:02:21.83,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}とこまでても行ける　もう大丈夫僕らなら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.95,0:02:23.41,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.54,0:02:24.96,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}ありのままで
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:28.17,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不安も迷いもあるけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.33,0:02:34.84,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}やってみなきゃわからない　事がたくさんあるんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.97,0:02:36.38,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.51,0:02:41.39,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}あのそらに届きそうなぐらいに手を伸ばす
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.47,0:02:44.48,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}僕らはもう一人じゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.64,0:02:49.65,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}新しい世界に飛び込むのさ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.66,0:03:01.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我之前從未聽說過什麼男子啦啦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.83,0:03:06.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怕生的我 居然會參加什麼啦啦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.87,0:03:10.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多愁善感模式嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.46,0:03:14.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站在場外幫人加油之後我才明白
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.09,0:03:18.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒法變得像姐姐那麼帥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.24,0:03:20.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很帥
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.16,0:03:24.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴你投摔對手的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.45,0:03:28.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,表情就好像自己被摔出去了似的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.63,0:03:38.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的柔道就帥在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.30,0:03:42.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一這樣說著 拉著放棄柔道的我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.51,0:03:44.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,進入了男子啦啦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.30,0:03:47.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這樣怎麼召集部員
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.77,0:03:51.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不試試怎麼知道行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.27,0:03:55.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那阿晴 你願意和我成立啦啦隊部？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.86,0:03:56.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:03:58.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.07,0:04:01.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得啦啦隊很適合你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.15,0:04:05.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總感覺得阿晴的應援聲裡有種為量
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.95,0:04:09.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴的應援聲裡藏著一股力量
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.13,0:04:17.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,試試就試試吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.67,0:04:22.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就知道阿晴會這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.43,0:04:25.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我心想 或許努力為別人加油
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.59,0:04:27.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全心全意參加啦啦隊活動
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.85,0:04:32.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或許能看到從未見過的景色
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.73,0:04:36.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來 笑得開點 手抬高 看前面
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.94,0:04:44.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我當然知道 你只要開始做一件事就會拼了命去做
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:50.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.99,0:04:52.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.08,0:04:53.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命志院
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.21,0:04:56.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.71,0:05:00.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.42,0:05:02.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 那個...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.92,0:05:03.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告辭
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.10,0:05:13.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還以為大清早沒人經過呢 丟人...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.77,0:05:18.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發小阿一竟然一直想組啦啦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.15,0:05:20.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這還是我第一次聽說
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.23,0:05:23.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的媽媽曾是啦啦隊員
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.95,0:05:27.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在大學時加入了啦啦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.57,0:05:29.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸是那裡的教練
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.41,0:05:32.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他倆後來結婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.70,0:05:37.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我小時候也聽說過好多次
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.79,0:05:42.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦隊是一群應援和鼓勵所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.25,0:05:44.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓大家都露出笑容的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.01,0:05:49.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想像這樣高高地飛上天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.14,0:05:53.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像她們一樣 打動別人的心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.47,0:05:55.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一 這難道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.60,0:05:59.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO Peaches
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.70,0:06:11.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想在學園祭的舞臺上做同樣的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.66,0:06:15.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一很小的時候父母雙亡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.58,0:06:19.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從他搬家來這裡之後 我就一直和他在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.83,0:06:23.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自從外婆住院 他就一直獨自生活
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.59,0:06:27.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柔道比我強 成績優秀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.94,0:06:29.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是免學費的特待生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.07,0:06:32.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是這樣一個相當厲害的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.90,0:06:36.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那邊那位想做些新鮮事的男生！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.32,0:06:39.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那邊那位想做些好玩的事的男生！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:43.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要和我們一起竭盡全力為別人應援呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.58,0:06:46.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到第七個人了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:49.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想請你加入我們的啦啦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.75,0:06:51.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我需要你們
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.51,0:06:53.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.63,0:06:55.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.38,0:06:56.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴能跳的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.51,0:07:00.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要給那些
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.97,0:07:03.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了一些目標而奮鬥的人們
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.77,0:07:04.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,率真的人們加油
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.90,0:07:09.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活力四射而又愉快的嶄新隊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.52,0:07:12.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一就像太陽一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.36,0:07:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在他火熱的意志下組建起來的男子啦啦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.28,0:07:19.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終於湊齊了七個人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.56,0:07:24.56,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(622.667,178.333)}{\c&HD59FE5&}啦啦隊入門
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.56,0:07:24.56,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(630.667,170.333)}{\c&HE4DB75&}啦啦隊入門
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.56,0:07:24.56,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,160)}啦啦隊入門
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.00,0:07:26.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在先稍作休息
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.83,0:07:29.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來為大家介紹一下啦啦隊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.67,0:07:33.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,cheer的意思是「為別人加油鼓勁」
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.22,0:07:35.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它不僅是單純的應援
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.67,0:07:37.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更是受到人們喜愛的體育競技項目
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.67,0:07:41.02,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦隊來源於美式足球賽事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.64,0:07:42.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦隊包括{\u1}啦啦舞{\u0}和{\u1}啦啦操{\u0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.64,0:07:42.06,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(648,620)}cheer dance
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.64,0:07:42.06,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(872,620)}cheer leading
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.56,0:07:47.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我們表演的 是以托舉為中心驚險技巧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.40,0:07:50.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再加上喊口號和笑容的啦啦操
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.77,0:07:54.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦操的最大特點即托舉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.74,0:07:57.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是啦啦隊特有的表演方式 類似於團體體操
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.61,0:07:59.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主要有三個位置
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.41,0:08:03.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個在最高處舉起雙手的人是尖子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.91,0:08:06.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感覺就像是最耀眼的明星
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.98,0:08:11.36,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,尖子：要求平衡性、柔韌性以及對身體的控制能力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.17,0:08:09.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為需要做跳躍動作 所以多由小個子擔任
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.21,0:08:12.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咱們之中的話 我和阿晴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.21,0:08:13.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.59,0:08:16.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抬著尖子的是底座
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.13,0:08:20.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要用肩膀扛起尖子 或是雙手把人托舉起來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.21,0:08:25.88,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,底座：要求保持軀幹穩定及下半身的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.05,0:08:22.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個位置適合體健壯的人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.31,0:08:24.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿遠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.14,0:08:30.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在後面扶著的是後點 作用是輔助底座
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.86,0:08:32.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是支撐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.14,0:08:37.92,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,後點：輔助尖子的動作，負責指揮整個托舉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.82,0:08:36.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如托舉尖子的時機等等 都得由後點來指揮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.65,0:08:37.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好比指揮台
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.70,0:08:40.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說的是我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.24,0:08:43.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,諸位 這幾個詞經常出現
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.80,0:08:46.58,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\c&HD59FE5&\u1\pos(640,76.667)}托舉的位置{\u0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.80,0:08:46.58,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(850,255.333)}尖子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.80,0:08:46.58,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(850,375.333)}底座
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.80,0:08:46.58,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(850,495.333)}後點
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.74,0:08:44.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要記住啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.50,0:08:52.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不...不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.50,0:08:55.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一個入部的是溝口
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.18,0:09:01.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別發出奇怪的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.26,0:09:05.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身體真夠僵硬的啊 溝口
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.89,0:09:07.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但頭腦和精神很柔韌
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.14,0:09:09.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得一樣僵硬
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.73,0:09:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但錢包和貞操堅不可摧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.40,0:09:13.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼冒出貞操來了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.94,0:09:18.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要以為機會會敲第二次門
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.78,0:09:21.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是法國的思想家桑弗說的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.20,0:09:24.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,溝口常把名言掛在嘴邊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.16,0:09:26.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把這當做我的機會
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.54,0:09:30.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我想打開這扇被敲響的門
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.83,0:09:34.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜歡參與新鮮的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.25,0:09:37.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想向沒人做過的事發起挑戰
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.07,0:09:43.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是一家大料亭的繼承人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.40,0:09:48.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然往我家屋頂上送訓練用具的時候 我嚇了一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.36,0:09:53.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是隊裡個子最高的一個 所以位置是後點
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.83,0:09:58.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖說他身體僵硬而且缺乏節奏感
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.46,0:10:02.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他是個會為同伴的成功高興到流淚的人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.88,0:10:09.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被人祝福的感覺真不錯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.43,0:10:11.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太誇張了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.85,0:10:15.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我以前一直是獨自奔跑著
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.06,0:10:17.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在田徑部是跑長跑的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.65,0:10:21.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成績在高中時也是名列前茅
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.69,0:10:27.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惜臨陣怯場 考前身體垮了複讀了兩年
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.37,0:10:32.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當時我的容身之處只有那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.37,0:10:36.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一聽我說話 都會莫名偷笑
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.62,0:10:38.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直和周圍格格不入
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.71,0:10:44.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們一味地煩惱 為喜悅而出生在這個世上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.71,0:10:46.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或許可以這樣說
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.30,0:10:51.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人生來是為了突破苦惱 贏得歡喜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.59,0:10:53.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貝多芬說的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.51,0:10:57.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想突破
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.02,0:11:00.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知能不能突破成功
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.15,0:11:04.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來入部的是阿遠
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.27,0:11:06.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巨大豬排咖喱最短紀錄保持者
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.44,0:11:10.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還以為是柔道部的歷代主將呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.70,0:11:14.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我高中時的照片 太不好意思了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.20,0:11:17.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過...為什麼選擇進啦啦隊？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.25,0:11:21.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想改變
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.75,0:11:25.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.34,0:11:29.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿遠沒多少體育運動的經驗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.72,0:11:33.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但看到傳單後 就立刻加入了男子啦啦隊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.05,0:11:36.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身體壯實的阿遠位置是底座
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.60,0:11:41.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我沒能撐住
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.98,0:11:45.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿遠有時對自己缺乏自信 顯得有些懦弱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.19,0:11:49.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但經過拼命訓練 他學會了後翻
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.07,0:11:52.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.95,0:11:55.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿遠 你在幹什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.95,0:12:03.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 今天我女朋友沒法來看 給她發消息呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.50,0:12:07.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是BREAKERS成員中唯一一個有女朋友的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.15,0:12:15.08,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(622.667,178.333)}{\c&HD59FE5&}啦啦隊入門
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.15,0:12:15.08,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(630.667,170.333)}{\c&HE4DB75&}啦啦隊入門
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.15,0:12:15.08,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,160)}啦啦隊入門
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.64,0:12:18.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面來說說{\u1}動作{\u0}和{\u1}翻騰{\u0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.64,0:12:18.85,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(684,620)}motion
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.64,0:12:18.85,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(821.333,620)}tumbling
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.31,0:12:24.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,動作就是指手、臂、腿的基本姿態
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.19,0:12:25.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始練動作
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.12,0:12:31.46,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,倒V:拇指朝前、手臂45度向下傾斜\N注意挺胸不要駝背
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.73,0:12:27.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是倒V
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.67,0:12:31.32,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(834.667,327.333)}錯誤的例子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.74,0:12:32.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高V
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.56,0:12:36.32,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(770.667,268.666)}錯誤的例子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.74,0:12:36.18,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,高V：與倒V相反，表現VICTORY的V
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.53,0:12:37.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舉臂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.85,0:12:42.08,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(732,267.333)}錯誤的例子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.56,0:12:42.06,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,舉臂：一手叉腰，舉起的手臂要緊貼太陽穴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.03,0:12:39.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這些是啦啦隊的基本動作
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.08,0:12:44.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高V 倒V 舉臂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.67,0:12:46.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一群人一起做 看起來很漂亮的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.92,0:12:48.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及拉伸也要每天做
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.84,0:12:51.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身體不夠柔韌的話容易受傷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:53.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對翻騰動作也有影晌
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.76,0:12:55.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翻...翻什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.59,0:12:58.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翻騰 指後翻或者空翻之類
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.24,0:13:00.94,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,翻騰：指在地面側手翻、前翻、後翻等旋轉跳躍的運動
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.50,0:13:06.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是做不到兩腳同時著地 就成普通的側手翻了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.00,0:13:10.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前翻時要從側面看成一條線
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.16,0:13:10.16,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,前翻：相對單腳著地的側手翻，前翻需要雙腳同時著地。\N是連續翻騰的助跑
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.47,0:13:14.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後兩腳同時著地
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.72,0:13:18.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,後翻也很穩定
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.56,0:13:26.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,後空翻也好高
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.69,0:13:27.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.61,0:13:30.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翻騰的速度和氣勢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.42,0:13:35.06,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\u1\pos(820,160.667)}{\c&HCD58D8&}動作
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.42,0:13:35.06,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(644,314)\i1}倒V · 高V · 舉臂{\fs50\b0}等
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.42,0:13:35.06,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\u1\pos(820,366)}{\c&HE4DB75&}翻騰
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.42,0:13:35.06,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,524.667)\i1}前翻 後翻 後空翻{\fs50\b0}等
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.03,0:13:33.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能使觀眾興奮起來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.37,0:13:45.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咋回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.29,0:13:47.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.34,0:13:53.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蟲 蟲爬到我胳膊上了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.17,0:13:56.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個被瓢蟲嚇哭的男生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.01,0:13:59.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是一郎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.68,0:14:00.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是翻騰啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.68,0:14:05.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到運動神經出眾的一郎和絃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.94,0:14:08.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一立刻決定挖他們入隊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.36,0:14:10.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被巨大豬排咖喱打敗的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.40,0:14:12.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,網球同好會？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.03,0:14:14.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也會
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.95,0:14:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瓢蟲
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.08,0:14:24.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,棒球部和足球部啊 怎麼現在進網球部了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.79,0:14:28.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為一直是搞體育的 身邊全是漢子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.67,0:14:33.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以想進大學之後找個時髦點的社團
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.51,0:14:35.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就你這腦袋還好意思說時髦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.01,0:14:40.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是...不覺得眼下不太符合你們的想法嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.85,0:14:45.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一郎是個天才 平時不管什麼事都能輕鬆做到
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.93,0:14:49.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以當弄傷手臂的時候 他才會焦躁不安
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.44,0:14:50.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.77,0:14:52.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不多練練就來不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.69,0:14:56.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話是沒錯 但還是先調整一下比較好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.95,0:14:59.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在難道不應該堅持嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.53,0:15:01.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可再練下去 還是...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.62,0:15:04.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越是做不到的時候 越該拿出毅力來繼續練啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.33,0:15:07.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這點小傷根本不算回事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.25,0:15:11.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,疼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.79,0:15:12.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一郎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.92,0:15:14.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.30,0:15:16.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.63,0:15:19.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,適可而止吧 你的傷還沒好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.34,0:15:21.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開我 已經沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.64,0:15:22.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.76,0:15:25.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這傷根本不是打工扭的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.56,0:15:31.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是自己訓練的時候弄傷的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.65,0:15:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,久等啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.36,0:15:35.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要吃這個？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.57,0:15:36.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.99,0:15:41.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成天想著要泡妞的弦是一郎的發小
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.70,0:15:44.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倆人平時總混在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.62,0:15:47.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你倆認識很久了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.04,0:15:54.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我從小學到初中都是和一郎一起打棒球的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.63,0:15:58.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一進球隊就立刻成了正選隊員
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.92,0:16:02.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,學長們引退後 二年級他就成了王牌投手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.51,0:16:06.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那小子 不管練什麼都練得特別快
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.43,0:16:09.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不明白別人「不甘心」的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.35,0:16:13.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可他真的是沒有任何惡意的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.61,0:16:15.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我懂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.36,0:16:18.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無論是對於一郎還是弦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.74,0:16:21.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要說我沒有不甘心 那是騙人的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.32,0:16:26.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但還是很純粹地覺得 你們好厲害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.31,0:16:31.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let'go 命志院
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.14,0:16:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.94,0:16:36.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.61,0:16:40.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,WE ARE CHEER BOYS
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.82,0:16:45.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們就想做些有新意又有意思的事 對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.36,0:16:47.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我倆加入了 啦啦隊可得更熱鬧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.37,0:16:55.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算入部動機是為了泡妞 也未嘗不可吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.75,0:17:00.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身體保持筆直
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.75,0:17:02.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還剰10秒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.71,0:17:03.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好累
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.17,0:17:06.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會覺得累是因為軀幹力量太弱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.47,0:17:13.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第七個與我們一同登上學園祭舞臺的是翔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.19,0:17:18.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔是隊員中唯一一個有啦啦隊經驗的人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.27,0:17:22.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一開始 他並不贊成全男生的隊伍
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.78,0:17:23.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿遠
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.61,0:17:24.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好險
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.28,0:17:31.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁著還沒受傷 放棄吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.12,0:17:34.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不放棄
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.33,0:17:41.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們要在明天的體育課上 讓你看到訓練成果
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.25,0:17:45.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 再來一次
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.47,0:17:48.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.80,0:17:53.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們這樣做後翻 手腕肯定會受傷的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.97,0:17:58.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就教教你們正確的方法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.19,0:18:02.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老實說答應入隊不就完了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.94,0:18:04.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連說話都這麼帥 好氣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.32,0:18:10.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔說不能參加托舉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.83,0:18:14.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能參加托舉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.95,0:18:17.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終於湊齊了七個人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.37,0:18:21.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但翔似乎還隱瞞了什麼苦衷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.09,0:18:25.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 多虧翔的加入
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.92,0:18:27.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們才有了快速的提升
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.47,0:18:30.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是個非常可靠的人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.97,0:18:33.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是便裝的品味有點糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.95,0:18:38.82,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(622.667,178.333)}{\c&HD59FE5&}啦啦隊入門
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.95,0:18:38.82,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(630.667,170.333)}{\c&HE4DB75&}啦啦隊入門
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.95,0:18:38.82,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,160)}啦啦隊入門
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.85,0:18:41.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最後來為大家介紹啦啦隊的精髓
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.19,0:18:42.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托舉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.27,0:18:46.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啦啦隊不可缺少的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.15,0:18:50.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管哪種表演 都少不了人塔技巧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.53,0:18:51.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.03,0:18:53.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.16,0:18:57.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要把尖子托到底座胸部高度
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.08,0:19:00.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好重
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.20,0:19:11.64,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,人塔：底座將站地手掌的尖子托到胸部高度的技巧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.29,0:19:05.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後屈膝 利用伸展的力量靠全身的力氣抬起來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.38,0:19:08.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尖子一口氣站起來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.26,0:19:11.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.80,0:19:16.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後高舉雙手 尖子站在頂端 這叫做高臂托舉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.16,0:19:20.40,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,高臂托舉：保持人塔的造型，底座伸直手臂抬起尖子的技巧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.56,0:19:24.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把尖子拋投到空中的動作叫做籃子拋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.38,0:19:29.36,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,籃子拋：底座用手組成籃子狀讓尖子起跳，\N在空中表演各種技術的華麗托舉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.94,0:19:26.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是個重要看點
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.39,0:19:34.48,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1015,123.333)}{\c&HCD58D8&\u1}托舉技例子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.39,0:19:34.48,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1015,242)}人塔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.39,0:19:34.48,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1015,370)}高臂托舉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.39,0:19:34.48,Title,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1015,506)}籃子拋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.75,0:19:33.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,托舉是啦啦隊表演最刺激的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.84,0:19:35.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不可缺少
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.68,0:19:39.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人步調一致完成造型時會有極大的成就感
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.93,0:19:42.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知大家對啦啦隊是否有了初步的認識了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.56,0:19:46.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.81,0:19:50.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦隊不是靠一個人努力就能成功的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.44,0:19:53.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管跳躍的人還是接的人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.28,0:19:55.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有彼此信賴的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.95,0:19:58.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技巧才能完成
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.20,0:20:01.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就堅持到成功為止吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.96,0:20:05.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想去破壞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.29,0:20:08.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無論是不認可全男生組建啦啦隊的人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.88,0:20:11.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是那些說我們做不到的人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.13,0:20:13.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想破壞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.13,0:20:15.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,破壞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.72,0:20:19.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打破那些說我們不行的人的常識
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.14,0:20:21.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打破我們自己
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.85,0:20:25.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.19,0:20:26.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是它了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.52,0:20:29.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,土帥土帥的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.36,0:20:30.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就比MEGANES差那麼一點
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.07,0:20:33.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞 來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.03,0:20:36.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咱們七個一起去破壞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.41,0:20:40.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就這樣 我們七個人終於在在初次表演中
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.20,0:20:42.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到了同樣的景色
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.21,0:20:52.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO GO
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.38,0:20:55.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,命志院 HEY COME ON
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.55,0:20:57.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,WE ARE BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.38,0:20:58.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,THIS IS SHOW TIME
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.97,0:21:00.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心情爽快
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.51,0:21:03.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B R E A K E R S
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.68,0:21:05.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.35,0:21:06.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.93,0:21:08.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,3 2 1 GO
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.83,0:21:50.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO BREAKERS
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.54,0:21:54.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是一年級的佐久間 叫我佐久就好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.33,0:21:56.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這支隊伍是學園祭上最搶眼的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.83,0:21:58.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我也想參加
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.84,0:22:02.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全男生的隊伍 肯定很有氣勢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.09,0:22:07.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,學園祭結束後 加入的隊員全是怪人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.01,0:22:09.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只覺得前途多舛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.85,0:22:11.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有沒有幹勁
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.52,0:22:13.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直都在撒謊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.10,0:22:16.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一和翔看起來不太對勁
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.60,0:22:19.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我也有不得不面對的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.77,0:22:21.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAKERS的未來將會如何
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.36,0:22:24.49,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.82,0:22:26.11,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.57,0:22:27.74,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,JUST DO IT！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.82,0:22:30.49,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO BREAKERS！！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.87,0:22:36.17,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,不由自主地大聲回應
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.33,0:22:39.75,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,嶄新大門打開的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.88,0:22:42.84,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,就像緊緊握住的拳頭
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.01,0:22:46.18,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,決意堅定地響起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.47,0:22:49.64,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,想要散發的能量 一直在等待
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.72,0:22:52.97,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,說實話感覺能改變些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.06,0:22:55.89,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,你總是在尋找
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.02,0:22:59.31,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,有趣的事情對嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.52,0:23:02.78,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有自信＜OH MY GOD！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.86,0:23:06.03,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,自暴自棄＜OH MY PRIDE！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.07,0:23:07.91,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,那天的自己 不要輸
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.99,0:23:09.49,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,送上應援的呼喊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.62,0:23:14.12,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,加油打氣的動作＜LET'S DANCE TOGETHER！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.24,0:23:17.50,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,YES FLY HIGH FLY DIVE 起飛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.62,0:23:21.09,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,垂頭喪氣抱怨「到極限了」＜NO！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.17,0:23:24.42,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAK UP BREAK OUT 打破極限＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.51,0:23:27.76,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向彼此微笑 流下汗水 SHOW YOUR GUTS GUTS＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.84,0:23:30.93,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向著晴空＜JUMP！JUMP！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.05,0:23:34.27,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,勝利的姿勢＜高V！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.35,0:23:37.39,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,連同心一起抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.52,0:23:41.23,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向著邂逅閃耀笑容的瞬間
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.31,0:23:44.15,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.27,0:23:48.78,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.87,0:22:36.17,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,思わず大きな返事してたんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.33,0:22:39.75,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,新しい扉ひらく声は
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.88,0:22:42.84,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ぎゅっと握ったこぶしみたいだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.01,0:22:46.18,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,頼もしそうに響く決意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.47,0:22:49.64,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,弾けたいエネルギー　ずっと待ってたんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.72,0:22:52.97,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ぶっちゃけたら何かを　変えられる気がして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.06,0:22:55.89,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,おもしろそうなこといつだって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.02,0:22:59.31,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,探してきたんだろ？そうだろ？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.52,0:23:02.78,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,自信なくて＜OH MY GOD！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.86,0:23:06.03,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ふてくされてた＜OH MY PRIDE！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.07,0:23:07.91,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,あの日の自分＜負けるな！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.99,0:23:09.49,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,エールを＜おくろう！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.62,0:23:14.12,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,元気づけるモーション＜LET'S DANCE TOGETHER！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.24,0:23:17.50,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,YES！FLY HIGH FLY DIVE　とびだせ！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.62,0:23:21.09,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,「もう限界」なんてうなだれは＜NO！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.17,0:23:24.42,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAK UP BREAK OUT　壊しちゃえばいい＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.51,0:23:27.76,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,笑いあって　汗をかいてSHOW YOUR GUTS！＜GUTS！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.84,0:23:30.93,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,青空へ＜JUMP！JUMP！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.05,0:23:34.27,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,勝利のポーズ＜HIGH V！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.35,0:23:37.39,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,心ごと掴め！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.52,0:23:41.23,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,キラめく笑顔に出会える瞬間へ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.53,0:23:55.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如永生一般擁有夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.87,0:23:57.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如今日就將死去一般活著
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.00,0:24:00.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這話正適合現在的我們
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.17,0:24:01.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必須帶著「今天是正式演出
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.21,0:24:03.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,過了今天沒明天」的想法拼命練
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.75,0:24:06.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,部員也增加了 咱們也得加把勁
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.51,0:24:08.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一集 RE.START
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.01,0:24:10.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO BREAKERS

